# Ledger

Cash flow tracker. FastAPI + SQLite backend, Next.js frontend. Backend owns all balance math; frontend only renders API data.

- Start: `.\start.ps1` (API :8000, app :3000). Stop this project: `.\stop.ps1`.
- Nav: `/` Dashboard, `/bank-flow`, `/credit-cards`, `/expenses`, `/setup`.
- Amounts stored positive. Direction from `item_type`.
- Card charges do not hit a bank until `payment_due`. That payment also pays the card down by the statement total.
- Do not cache computed balances in the database.
- After UI changes, verify the flow in the browser.
